            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An aerosol generating article for use in a non-combustible aerosol generating device includes a filtering mouthpiece, an aerosol generating segment and a spacer element positioned between the aerosol generating segment and the filtering mouthpiece. The aerosol generating segment and the filtering mouthpiece are wrapped at least partially by a first wrapper, and the aerosol generating segment is wrapped with a second wrapper. At least one of the first wrapper and the second wrapper comprises a part of a common tobacco plant leaf.</p>
            </abstract>
